# Articles (format §6). Written from own knowledge.

el           det  type=art definite=def forms=el,la,los,las note=el also before feminine nouns with stressed a- (el agua)
lo           det  type=art definite=def number=sg note=neuter article: lo bueno, lo que dices
uno          det  type=art definite=ind forms=un,una,unos,unas note=un also before feminine nouns with stressed a- (un hacha)
